WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.467
Just Speak to It for Mac. Everything here is sample data.

00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:11.100
In any app, double-tap your shortcut to start. Here, a test driver presses it.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:17.433
Speak naturally. This demo plays a synthetic clip, not a live microphone.

00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:22.000
Tap again to stop. A test fixture returns fixed text.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.533
The text lands right where you were typing.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:34.033
Every dictation is saved to History.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:40.333
Pick on-device models that keep audio on your Mac, or a cloud provider with your own key.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:44.100
Download it for Mac at justspeaktoit.com.
